#: src/Form/UrlForm.php:17
msgid "DSpace site URL"
msgstr "URL del DSpace"

#: src/Form/UrlForm.php:18
msgid ""
"The URL of the repository you want to connect to (DSpace 5.6 or higher) Fill"
" this in, then click \"Get collections and communities\" to browse what you "
"want to import."
msgstr ""
"L'URL del repositori que voleu connectar (versió 5.6 o superior). Podeu "
"indicar-la al camp \"Veure col·leccions i comunitats\" per triar el que "
"voleu importar."

#: src/Form/UrlForm.php:30
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Endpoint"

#: src/Form/UrlForm.php:31
msgid ""
"The endpoint for the API. For DSpace versions lower than 7.x, change to "
"\"rest\"."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/UrlForm.php:45
msgid ""
"The maximum number of results to retrieve from each DSpace API call. Applies"
" to all resources (communities, collections, items and files) as well as "
"Test Import option on next screen. If you notice errors or missing data, try"
" lowering this number. Increasing it might make imports faster."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ImportForm.php:36
msgid "Test import"
msgstr "Prova d'importació"

#: src/Form/ImportForm.php:48
msgid "Import files into Omeka S"
msgstr "Importa els fitxers en l'Omeka S"

#: src/Form/ImportForm.php:49
msgid ""
"If checked, original files will be imported into Omeka S. Otherwise, "
"derivates will be displayed when possible, with links back to the original "
"file in the DSpace repository."
msgstr ""
"Si està seleccionat, els fitxers originals s'importaran a l'Omeka S. En cas "
"contrari, es mostrarà un derivat a partir d'un enllaç al repositori DSpace "
"d'origen."

#: src/Form/ImportForm.php:67
msgid "Delete missing items on update"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ImportForm.php:68
msgid ""
"Delete Omeka S items not found in DSpace on a rerun/update. If unchecked, "
"items removed from DSpace collection will remain in Omeka S."
msgstr ""

